11
00:00:19,375 --> 00:00:20,975
30 a few hours later,

12
00:00:21,195 --> 00:00:23,495
and 80 or 90 later that day.

13
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:25,120
When a dealer has plenty of

14
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:27,030
Gold Eagles or one-ounce bars,

15
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:28,720
the premium may drop to

16
00:00:28,730 --> 00:00:29,850
