17
00:00:30,315 --> 00:00:32,155
So it isn't a permanent markup.

18
00:00:32,515 --> 00:00:34,175
The market largely sets it.

19
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:35,500
To judge a premium,

20
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:36,890
